---
---

<section id="about" class="section about rule-top" data-reveal>
	<div class="grid">
		<div>
			<h2>About</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="copy">
			<p>
				At Bosch I'm a fullstack and DevOps developer on an internal service that manages parts
				across production lines — Angular front end, C# back end, and the deployment side of it.
				The product is early; I've been on it from the start.
			</p>
			<p class="muted">
				Alongside it I'm studying Business Informatics at the University of South Bohemia — the
				part I actually use is reading a business process well enough to know what the software
				has to do before anyone writes code.
			</p>
			<p class="faint">Off the clock: cycling, running, and a homelab that keeps finding new ways to need attention.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		padding: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px) 0;
	}

	.grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
		gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font: 500 12px/1 "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ink3);
	}

	.copy {
		grid-column: span 2;
		min-width: 0;
		max-width: 66ch;
	}

	.copy p {
		margin: 0 0 18px;
		font: 400 clamp(16px, 1.9vw, 19px) / 1.65 "IBM Plex Sans", sans-serif;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.muted {
		color: var(--ink2);
	}

	.faint {
		margin-bottom: 0 !important;
		font: 400 15px/1.6 "IBM Plex Sans", sans-serif !important;
		color: var(--ink3);
	}
</style>
